Just look at the driver modules, they only post
PA_CORE_MESSAGE_UNLOAD_MODULE and PA_MESSAGE_SHUTDOWN , and wait for
PA_MESSAGE_SHUTDOWN

i.e. the driver modules are unlikely to cause "asyncq overrun"


